## What Are Mobile App Penetration Testing Services?

Mobile app penetration testing is a cybersecurity assessment that evaluates Android and iOS applications for potential vulnerabilities through authorized testing techniques. Security professionals examine application code, authentication mechanisms, data storage, network communication, and access controls to identify weaknesses before attackers can exploit them.

These assessments help organizations understand their security risks and implement effective protection measures.

